There are other ways to deal with this situation as a Pacifist. Beware
since this might be spoilerish. The first method will cost some luck.
Strip naked and squeeze to same square as the boulder. Now you can
displace youe pet to the boulder. From there on you can let the pet
take care of it. If available you can simply magic whistle your pet
back to you. Otherwise your pet might jump in to the hole behind the
boulder.
Another option is to magic whistle your pet behind the boulder. This
will not even involve a luck penalty. Magic whistles really are your
friend when playing pacifist. The pets sometimes end up in the weirdest
places. It is in fact even possible to move your pet right into the
little cellars containing the sokoban prize. You'd have to bring a
whole gang of pets though to achieve this effect.

